// Package notifyv1 holds the Go messages and the gRPC client and server of the
// NotifyService (Specifications.md §3.5.3, §3.6), generated by buf (task
// gen-proto, api/proto/buf.gen.yaml) from api/proto/memobrain/v1/notify.proto.
// notify.pb.go and notify_grpc.pb.go are generated: change the .proto and
// regenerate, never edit them by hand. This file is written by hand and
// survives regeneration.
//
// It lives in the shared module so the server (services/cloud/internal/grpcserver)
// and the client (apps/desktop/internal/sync/transport, notify.go) use the same
// types. The Server-Sent Events fallback, GET /api/v1/events, carries the same
// events as JSON (services/cloud/internal/notify/sse.go, documented in
// api/openapi.yaml under x-memobrain-external-routes).
package notifyv1
